Exod 1:1 , The children of Israel, after Joseph's death, increase;
Exod 1:8 , The more they are oppressed by a new king, the more they multiply;
Exod 1:15 , The godliness of the midwives, in saving the men children alive;
Exod 1:22 , Pharaoh commands the male children to be cast into the river.
